 65	 * snapshot then INSERTs `fresh` — blessing exactly the membership Slack just
 66	 * told us was gone. Writing the row makes the departure visible to
 67	 * `markAclFresh`'s freshness fence, which refuses to bless a snapshot older
 68	 * than it.
