    13	 * idempotent no-op.
    14	 *
    15	 * Not a general edge kernel either: `entity-merge`'s repoint/tombstone and
    16	 * `force_delete_tree`'s hard delete stay where they are, because their SQL is
    17	 * ordering-dependent and set-based.
    18	 */
